  unitName: Dismal Omen Luro
  unitId: 860998
  unitNumber: 8654
  description: "Silently, the owl followed them between the hanging vines. Tall,
    skittish; bulky, jovial; short, with a temper to match. Luro watched each of
    the young hunters in turn and smiled to himself. Perhaps it was pride that led
    them to take the road less traveled, or the misguided notion that untrodden paths
    lead to greater rewards. Naivety had all but blinded them to the forest's dangers,
    and before long, they would surely pay the dire price.A soft hoot echoed through
    the dark forest, setting off a ripple of tension in the hunting party. The young
    men exchanged uneasy glances, but they pressed on nonetheless. The fools\u2014there
    was nothing there but a steep fall. Luro flitted closer and opted for a closer
    branch this time. His second call drew the attention of the leader, whose face
    paled at the sight of that blind silver eye.The floor decided to fall away at
    that very moment, detritus scattering into the deep void of the hidden cliffs
    below. With a startled yelp, the bulky man leapt backwards, nearly flattening
    his smaller companion. In hushed and frightened tones, the men quickly decided
    to abandon their venture, fleeing under the cold watch of the moon.Such was the
    power of Owl's dire omen\u2014for Luro was punished by the Great Spirit, and
    his call would forever herald misfortune. But none knew the whole truth of it;
    whether he rejected his own beliefs or buried the truth in the dark nights he
    inhabits. No one save the strange little girl and her prophetic book.Luro would
    have his justice and free himself of those shackles\u2014but was blind to the
    key in his own hand."
  summonDesc: You're not here just for my company.<br>So. What do you want?
  fusionDesc: Heed or shun,<br>the choice is yours.<br>Heh heh heh...
  evoDesc: And in the days to come...<br>Man will hear my voice, and tremble...
  element: 6
  rarity: 7
